      "headingRaw": "Five-character-regular-verseLiBaiAFAREWELLTOAFRIEND",
      "translationRaw": "Withabluelineofmountainsnorthofthewall，Andeastofthecityawhitecurveofwater，HereyoumustleavemeanddriftawayLikealoosenedwater-planthundredsofmiles。。。。Ishallthinkofyouinafloatingcloud；Sointhesunsetthinkofme。。。。Wewaveourhandstosaygood-bye，Andmyhorseisneighingagainandagain。",
